"Reserve Bank" means the Reserve Bank of India constituted under section 3 of the Reserve Bank of India Act, 1934 (
2 of 1934
);
(p)
"share" means a share in the capital of the Corporation;
(q)
"shareholder" means a person registered by the Corporation as the holder of a share;
(r)
"scheduled bank" means a bank for the time being included in the Second Schedule to the Reserve Bank of India Act,
1934 (
2 of 1934
);
(s)
"State Bank" means the State Bank of India constituted under section 3 of the State Bank of India Act, 1955 (
23 of 1955
);

