obtained by such industrial concern in connection with such contract;
(c)
subscribing to or purchasing or underwriting the issue of stocks, shares, bonds or debentures of any institution which
may be notified by the Central Government in this behalf;
(d)
providing credit to any State level agency or other prescribed institution or agency for grant of loans and advances to
industrial concerns;
(e)
providing or obtaining credit from other public financial institutions, scheduled banks and State co-operative banks, for
grant of loans and advances to or to furnish guarantees on behalf of the industrial concern;
(f)
providing infrastructural facilities and raw materials;
(g)
